    "zh": "需求预测与计划独立需求助手",
    "en": "Demand Forecast & PIR Planning Assistant"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "汇总销售需求、历史订单与计划独立需求，识别预测偏差并形成可审计的 PIR 调整建议。",
    "en": "Combines sales demand, order history and planned independent requirements to explain forecast gaps and recommend auditable PIR adjustments."
  },
  "status": "Three-stage live acceptance blocked",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "owner": "PP Demand Planning / Sales Planning",
  "tags": [
    "Demand Forecast",
    "PIR",
    "Sales Demand",
    "Planning"
  ],
